  "raw": "Strona ekspertki kredytowej"
 },
 "content": {
  "raw": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 40px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(56px, 6.7vw, 96px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 40px);padding-bottom:clamp(56px, 6.7vw, 96px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-okruszki\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-okruszki\"><a href=\"/\">Strona główna</a> › <a href=\"/realizacje/\">Realizacje</a> › Strona ekspertki kredytowej</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-hero-tekst\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-hero-tekst\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-etykieta-piasek\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-etykieta-piasek\">Projekt demonstracyjny</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Strona ekspertki kredytowej, która <em>umawia</em> konsultacje</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-wstep\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-wstep\">Anna Nowak z Krakowa jest fikcyjna, a strona działa naprawdę: tak wygląda wizytówka, którą doradca dostaje w pakiecie „Wizytówka, która umawia”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"ze-strzalka\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button ze-strzalka\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#demo\">Zobacz demo na żywo</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#ankieta\">Wyceń stronę w 5 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-lista-kropki\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-lista-kropki\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Branża: doradztwo kredytowe</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pakiet: Wizytówka, która umawia</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firma i dane są fikcyjne</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"backgroundColor\":\"piasek\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"problem\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-piasek-background-color has-background\" id=\"problem\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"40%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">01 · Problem</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Klient szuka jej <em>wieczorem</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60%\",\"className\":\"mp-akapity\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column mp-akapity\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Polecony klient sprawdza ekspertkę w Google po pracy i widzi tylko numer telefonu. O 21:00 już nie zadzwoni, więc rano umawia się z kimś, kto odebrał pierwszy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A gdy dochodzi do rozmowy, pierwsza konsultacja idzie na zbieranie podstaw: kwota, wkład własny, forma zatrudnienia.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"rozwiazanie\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"rozwiazanie\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-naglowek-sekcji\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-naglowek-sekcji\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">02 · Rozwiązanie</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Trzy elementy, które <em>odbierają</em> telefon za nią</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"20px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"280px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"/> <path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"/> <path d=\"M12 11h4\"/> <path d=\"M12 16h4\"/> <path d=\"M8 11h.01\"/> <path d=\"M8 16h.01\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Formularz wstępnej analizy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Klient podaje kwotę, wkład własny i formę zatrudnienia w przedziałach, bez PESEL i skanów.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"/> <path d=\"M16 2v3\"/> <rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M3 9h18\"/> <path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kalendarz konsultacji</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Wybiera termin online albo w biurze, także wieczorem, i dostaje potwierdzenie e-mailem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719\"/> <path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"/> <path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Odpowiedzi na pytania</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pięć najczęstszych pytań, m.in. o dokumenty, wkład własny i koszt konsultacji, napisanych jej słowami.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"backgroundColor\":\"piasek\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"jak-dziala\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-piasek-background-color has-background\" id=\"jak-dziala\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-naglowek-sekcji\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-naglowek-sekcji\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">03 · Jak to działa</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Od wyszukiwania do <em>potwierdzenia</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-jak-dziala\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"32px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"bottom\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-jak-dziala\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":15,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"mp-laptop\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full mp-laptop\"><img src=\"https://mateuszprzetocki.pl/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/demo-laptop.webp\" alt=\"Pierwszy ekran strony ekspertki kredytowej na komputerze, z wyborem terminu\" class=\"wp-image-15\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Komputer: od pierwszego ekranu widać, z kim klient się umawia i kiedy.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":12,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"mp-telefon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full mp-telefon\"><img src=\"https://mateuszprzetocki.pl/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/telefon-pytania-termin.webp\" alt=\"Najczęstsze pytania i wybór godziny na telefonie\" class=\"wp-image-12\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Telefon: odpowiedzi i wybór godziny.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":13,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"mp-telefon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full mp-telefon\"><img src=\"https://mateuszprzetocki.pl/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/telefon-potwierdzenie.webp\" alt=\"Potwierdzenie rezerwacji na telefonie\" class=\"wp-image-13\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Telefon: potwierdzenie, a u niej komplet odpowiedzi.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"film\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"film\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"40%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">04 · Film</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zobacz to w <em>90</em> sekund</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"grafit\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-grafit-color has-text-color\">Nagranie ekranu z moim komentarzem: jak klient znajduje stronę, czyta odpowiedzi i umawia konsultację.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"czern\",\"textColor\":\"szary-na-czerni\",\"className\":\"is-style-film is-style-ciemna\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"14px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-film is-style-ciemna has-szary-na-czerni-color has-czern-background-color has-text-color has-background\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m16 13 5.223 3.482a.5.5 0 0 0 .777-.416V7.87a.5.5 0 0 0-.752-.432L16 10.5\"/> <rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Miejsce na film 60–90 s</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"backgroundColor\":\"piasek\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"co-dostaje\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-piasek-background-color has-background\" id=\"co-dostaje\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"55%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">05 · Co dostaje klient</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gotowa strona w ok. 2 <em>tygodnie</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tak samo działa strona, którą dostajesz w pakiecie „Wizytówka, która umawia”. Teksty piszę z Twojej ankiety, a domena i strona są na Ciebie.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-lista-ikon\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"10px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-lista-ikon\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-punkt\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"12px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-punkt\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona-gola\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/> <path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Termin: ok. 2 tygodnie od otrzymania materiałów</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-punkt\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"12px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-punkt\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona-gola\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"/> <path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"/> <path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"/> <path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2 rundy poprawek i 30 dni wsparcia</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-punkt\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"12px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-punkt\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona-gola\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"/> <path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Domena i strona są Twoje</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"45%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:45%\"><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"article\",\"className\":\"is-style-pakiet-polecany\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-group is-style-pakiet-polecany\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-etykieta-czarna\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-etykieta-czarna\">Polecam</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wizytówka, która umawia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-cena\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-cena\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1 800</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>zł</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mp-dla\"} -->\n<p class=\"mp-dla\">Gdy chcesz mniej telefonów i krótsze pierwsze rozmowy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-lista-pakiet\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-lista-pakiet\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Jedna strona, 6 sekcji, wersja na telefon</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Formularz wstępnych pytań i kalendarz konsultacji</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Odpowiedzi na najczęstsze pytania i miejsce na opinie</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Profil Firmy w Google, gdy firma spełnia wytyczne</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"ze-strzalka\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button ze-strzalka\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#ankieta\">Wyceń stronę w 5 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></article>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"nastepny-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"nastepny-krok\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">06 · Następny krok</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"czern\",\"textColor\":\"krem\",\"className\":\"is-style-cta is-style-ciemna\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<di